    {
      "text": "Table 1 (page 8 / printed page 7): Process framework for maternal health services across four functional columns — Patient Administration (Registration [green], Scheduling [grey], Admission [grey], Discharge [grey], Referral [green]), Patient Care (Routine Antenatal Care [green], Routine Delivery Community [green], Routine Delivery Facility [green], Routine Post-natal [green], Emergency Care [green], Community Health Support [green], Community Follow up [green], Diagnostic Services Support [grey]), Patient Fees and Accounting (Assess Charges [grey], Billing [grey]), and Planning, Management & Surveillance (Determine target client population [green], Reporting [grey], Monitor Performance & Quality [grey], Manage Staff [grey], Manage Inventory [grey]) — where green cells denote the ten priority maternal health business processes selected for task-flow diagrams and detailed requirements.",
